Third-Party Model Weights and Neural Assets Notice
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The software codebase of Wiggle-3D is licensed under the MIT License above.

When executed, the software may optionally download and execute pretrained
neural network model weights from upstream repositories to perform feature
point extraction and face detection. These pretrained model weights remain
subject to their respective upstream licenses:

1. SuperPoint Pretrained Weights:
   - Copyright (c) Magic Leap, Inc.
   - Licensed under the Magic Leap Non-Commercial Research License
     (Research and evaluation purposes only).
   - Upstream: https://github.com/magicleap/SuperPointPretrainedNetwork

2. RetinaFace-MobileNet0.25 Pretrained Weights:
   - Based on InsightFace / MobileNetV1-0.25 trained on the WiderFace dataset.
   - Upstream: https://github.com/deepinsight/insightface
